Source: dot-os-archive-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: DOT OS project <maintainers@dot-os.invalid>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), gnupg
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: dot-os-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: signing key and source entry for the DOT OS package archive
 Installs the public key that DOT OS packages are signed with, an APT source
 entry for the DOT OS archive (on by default), and an APT preference that
 pins the archive above Debian's own packages, so the DOT OS builds of
 Dolphin, System Settings, the KDE file widgets and Calamares always win and
 theme updates arrive with apt upgrade.
